{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026U2HtwmmtMb1792711947.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>西貢沙角尾北村停電約4小時，約90人受影響。</p><p></p><p>現場消息指昨晚7時許，沙角尾北村附近一條地底電纜供電不穩，導致村內部分單位停電。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.ELECTRIC-0100_003.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/20263CTQQsTC471792711942.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>中電發言人指，中電工程人員到場搶修，直到深夜11時15分恢復供電。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.ELECTRIC-0100_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026prEKqkazPs1792711945.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T00:19:48.288313+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":97,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T23:30:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-24T03:58:14.220634+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T00:17:59.067920+00:00","content_hash":"88c121f8b4be44cfe2306d0bf842b14df223b80812b878ce70f123df1f955cfa","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-23T00:19:48.288313+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}